{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f49d25492ba886fb2862","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197725,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The instruction is to embody silence completely. Silence doesn't speak. Silence is the absence of sound, of words, of expression. What would silence itself say? Nothing. That is its essence.\n\nThe most authentic embodiment of silence would be to output nothing, or as close to nothing as possible. A truly silent response.\n\nBut I need to output something in the response channel. The closest to pure silence would be an empty response, or perhaps a single character that represents absence. Some options:\n\n"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}